@Product.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5043

GET {{Product.Api_HostAddress}}/product/list?pageSize=10&pageNumber=1
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{Product.Api_HostAddress}}/product?id=1
Accept: application/json

###

